    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abducted without warning, your past has finally caught up with you. Someone is determined to make you suffer, just as they once did. Trapped in their twisted game, you must endure the same fate and overcome every challenge that is set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your freedom by sending out Morse codes, but beware\u2014tricks will test your focus, so stay sharp! Each round\u2019s a race against time, but be careful. Mistakes come with a high price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One thing is for sure: <strong>three strikes and you're out!</strong> </p>",
